UKI's cloud-init fork, built for pfSense images.

Based on upstream cloud-init (https://cloud-init.io/) with added support for
pfSense as a distro (cloudinit/distros/pfsense.py, config.xml-based user/
group/password/hostname management) and as a network renderer
(cloudinit/net/pfsense.py, reconciles cloud-init's desired interfaces into
config.xml's <interfaces> without disturbing manually-added config).

Packaged separately from the real net/cloud-init port under a distinct name
(cloud-init-uki) to avoid pkg repo-priority ambiguity if both are ever
configured on the same box.

WWW: https://github.com/uki-code/cloud-init
